<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-STEAUA BUCHAREST WIN EUROPEAN CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STEAUA BUCHAREST WIN EUROPEAN CUP PRELIMINARY ROUND TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a European Cup qualifying round second leg soccer match played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>CSKA Sofia (Bulgaria) 0 Steaua Bucharest (Romania) 2 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest - Dennis Serban, 35, Laurentiu Reghenkampf, 49</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Steaua Bucharest won 5-3 on aggregate</p>
</text>
